<title>UK: Societe Generale adds 500 mln FFR to bond.</title>
<headline>Societe Generale adds 500 mln FFR to bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale has added 500 million French francs to its 1.0 billion French franc 6.0 percent March 2007 bond.</p>
<p>The subordinated bonds will be redenominated in euros after European economic and monetary union (EMU).</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN FRF   COUPON     6.0 PCT   MATURITY    12.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.31    PAY DATE    12.MAR.97</p>
<p> REOFFER    101.31    SPREAD     +43 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    PAR/LUX</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 10-100</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
